{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n>"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋にてライブをさせていただきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本音を言えば...\n初ライブは皆でやりたかった...\n私はまだ未熟で...\n出る曲も少なくて..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと頑張らないといけない!!って思いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はじめてのライブで嬉しい気持ちと不安な気持ちもありましたが、\n無事成功することができました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここまでこれたのも皆さまが支えてくれて、そばにいてくれたからです!!\n声援聞こえましたよ〜♪\nとっても心に響きました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さまが居てくれるから今の私がいます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございます。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、ライブ中に重大発表がりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"渋谷パルコ劇場で公演することになりましたーーー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うれしーっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、どんなんになるんだろー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも頑張らなきゃっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いませっちゃんねぇーちゃんといるんだけど、"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃちっちゃい小屋みたいなのがあったのー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしたら、\n宮澤\n『なんかウサギ小屋みたい』\n和田\n『せめて犬小屋にしよ』\n宮澤\n『豚小屋でしょっ！』\n和田\n『さっきうさぎゆーたやん』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もーまじ面白い"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、\nいま\n『乗り越し精算いるかも』\nっていったら\n『だれそれ？』\nって真顔でゆわれた！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ノリコシが名字で名前がセイ\nだとおもったのかな？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうお腹かかえてゲラゲラ笑ったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラジオではもう終わりのシメをゆうのに、\n『はい！ 皆さんこんにちわ！』\nっていったからねぇー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"始めに言う言葉だよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうサイコーだよーんっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さまのお盆の過ごし方読みました〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仕事のかたや、旅行やゆっくりされてる方と、皆さま体調に気を付けて暑い夏を乗りきりましょう〜!!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつか会える日を楽しみにしています〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も１日ガッツで頑張りまあや〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これ食べたら元気もりもりになるよ〜！って食物ってなんですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0011.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}